{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_10_end","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_10","title":"禮儀廣場","storyCode":"SN-10","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"22890092cd663fd67ed74748d7680f8e762cb3995fd04e181f61ed2f4514daf8","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斯圖提斐拉號在激戰中沉沒，一次嶄新的探索被海洋輕而易舉地毀滅。最普通的喬迪拯救了最多的生命，可無人再來拯救阿戈爾與伊比利亞。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這，不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真是這樣，從一開始，深海獵人們尋找的東西竟然就如此之近......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這種可能性象徵的東西太過惡劣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞之眼始終注視著災難的餘波。但它只是一隻沉淪的眼眸，它無法言語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這意味著什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這意味著阿戈爾潰敗的速度在加快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也意味著......如果連這個距離的城市都會發出求援信號，那麼“愚人號”從一開始就只是在它們巢穴的上方打轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......獵人們有危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在想什麼，但我們只有一艘船，兩個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救援斯圖提斐拉並不現實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您也許不介意幾名深海獵人命喪大海，但我們扼殺的是機會。對阿戈爾和伊比利亞而言都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......達里奧已經戰死。您難道不想從剩下的那位審判官嘴裡，獲取寶貴的知識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"這是最後的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。一座幾近崩潰的、無能為力的城市，意味著其中有多少已經倒向海洋的阿戈爾人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們應該謹慎對待，否則無異於引火焚身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使如此，這也是，最後的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"等到阿戈爾再不回應任何訊息，直到又一次靜謐降臨在伊比利亞頭頂，真正的敵人才會顯現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"可那沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我理解您背負的職責，在懲戒軍真正接管這裡之前，您不會選擇任何冒險的舉措。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我一人去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不低估你和你那隻寵物的力量。但路途遙遠，你一個人真能安然無恙地抵達？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"獵人們流著特殊的血。恐魚未必會對尋常的船隻產生過大的敵意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望這不只是你試圖取得我的認同而編撰出的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不會編撰這樣的話語。我只是不能拋下獵人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要把獵人們和艾麗妮都帶回來，凱爾希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我會的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那、那個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能幫上什麼忙嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，警戒周圍，如果那些恐魚躲回了海面下的巢穴，就別刺激它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我們需要點時間，這艘船已經在剛才的航行中有所損傷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（點頭回應）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這艘船......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"先前獵人們乘坐的是審判庭的諜報人員留下的船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而卡門閣下的原計劃是在格蘭法洛與懲戒軍會合，建立前線指揮部後，乘中型水陸軍艦前往這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以這艘被遺留在格蘭法洛沙灘上的孤舟，是我們最後的希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我來幫忙......我去船上稍微看看。雖然我從來沒修過船，呃，不過我還是帶著一些工具的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，只靠這艘船，真的能深入大海嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你覺得不能，那就一定不能——等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開！喬迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐、恐魚——！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"潛藏在礁石的陰影下？Mon3tr！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（歡快的尖嘯）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"喬迪！從船上跳下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可是有什麼在推著這艘船！船錨已經不見了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我試著把它開回來——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"跳船！恐魚群在包圍它！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，把他救回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等——這樣我們會失去這艘船的，我、我試著駕駛它，呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身後！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"先去救喬迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（回應的歡鳴）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"漩渦，洋流在變化，恐魚也格外活躍......發生了什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸爪示意）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是要我抓著你飛回去嗎？可是這樣，這艘船就——唔！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"npc_10002","isRemote":false,"text":"（催促的尖嘯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"喬迪知道，如果不抓住眼前的機會，他只能隨著船隻一同漂泊，漂向無盡的大海。\n他其實沒有選擇。回到伊比利亞之眼，躲藏在燈塔中。\n就像十幾年來躲藏在那座小鎮上那樣。\n就像達里奧死戰時那樣。\n就像蒂亞戈那樣。\n他死死抓住桅杆，避免在異常的海浪中摔倒。Mon3tr明顯露出了不滿的神情，它在催促。\n恐魚時不時躍出水面，砸起一片水花，速度很快，離伊比利亞之眼已經有了些許距離。\n他看見了桅杆上歪歪扭扭刻著一行字：\n“格蘭法洛”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我替凱爾希去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要......找到那艘船，把大家接回來就行，對吧？聽上去沒什麼難的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起在這裡失去這艘船，然後一起在那座燈塔下面無助地等待，我們只能賭一把了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g22_goldenboat_hall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要有一個同胞觸碰到生命的終極答案，我們就可以從頭到尾編織整片星空的律法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下一位祂給予我們啟示前，我們會自尋方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使，伊莎瑪拉拒絕回答。即使，種群仍然無法獲悉祂的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們依然會生存延續。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鯊魚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞的意志已經傳達。養分充足，我們沒有必要相互捕食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我應當回歸巢穴。你們可以與我一同歸巢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"躲得真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"它沒有受到什麼實際性傷害，但這艘船已經破爛不堪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在說這種話嗎，阿瑪雅？為什麼不願意老老實實被我殺死呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族群呼喚我回歸，呼喚我與它們共用果實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我回應它們，等結束之後，我再回應你，我再找到你，你再殺死我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......當然不能放你回去了。放你回去，這附近的海域會多出多少像你這樣的海嗣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿瑪雅可真能給我出難題，要是她也像昆圖斯那麼簡單直接該多好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那支舞沒能把她留下，太可惜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"話太多了！垃圾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g23_goldenboat_pass"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。我一直想見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"發生了什麼？為什麼祂不再說話？祂在哪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"啐，就像攪動海水一樣，根本沒有砍中的感覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂是你嗎？你是祂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你在講什麼。如果你指的是那個大傢伙，那祂已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死亡，凋零，祂不存在於這個概念之中。祂的聲音，絕非指向生命的終點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼稱呼祂？像那些教徒一樣嗎？你們的神已經枯萎，墜入萬丈深淵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。我們這麼稱呼祂——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Ishar-mla。\n我在。\n我們遭受的苦永在。\n我們渴望的生永在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......Ishar-mla。我再次感受到，祂的脈動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞。你們同遊至祂的住所，將死亡也溺死在深淵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們失去了與祂的聯繫，但祂所選，只會指向未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同胞，你的資訊......不，你情緒激動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你感受到了，Ishar-mla。因為你離開了乾旱的陸地，回到了家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你流淌著我們的血，你流淌著祂的血，你就是祂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"我是深海獵人，斯卡蒂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無妨。你說是，那麼你就是。深海獵人，Ska-di。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla，我們等著祂的答案。祂會在漫長時間的那頭，給我們答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之前，在答案到來的盡頭前——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——大群將永生。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭無聲地出現在海嗣的身後，她手中的長槊確實貫穿了海嗣的身體。\n隨後傳來的，是鏈鋸轉動的雜音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的動作變慢了，你正在變得虛弱，那不如安心被攪碎吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"——還不夠，太淺了！唔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火焰的溫度順著長長的走廊傳遞。斯圖提斐拉號在發出哀嚎。\n海嗣沒有攻擊露出破綻的斯卡蒂。\n它只是靜靜地端詳著她。這種感覺很奇怪。和鹽風城那時一樣。\n它“看著”自己，斯卡蒂想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這艘船......到極限了。它很快就會沉沒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它想逃！唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"腳下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會讓你回到大海裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你很弱小，人類。作為養分，也無法滋養足夠多的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，養分充足，我們需要時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡離你的領地很遠。你沒有理由阻攔我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，和你的族群，無法被律法審判。我想，我可能也無法為伊比利亞抹除你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"律法？生存的累贅規則，阿瑪雅如是說過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起同胞，你確實羸弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——但我不會放過你，海洋渣滓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是最後一炮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......果然，我甚至都，咳，不能給你留下傷痕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......情緒。很奇怪，人類。你很弱小，你出於情緒驅使，試圖逃離我的捕食。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃離，對，逃離。恐懼？但你為什麼還站著？為什麼要攻擊我？為什麼......不遊開我的身邊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......也在向你的大群“奉獻”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你自以為有審訊我的資格嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣不再有話語。眼前的生物並非同胞。\n捕食不需要名為語言的工具。\n但是在它動手之前，從昏暗的天花板上，落下了一道黑影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿方索！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，它變成這副模樣後，我都沒見過它血的顏色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這場狩獵——啐。就快結束了。你殺了我的大副，你會，付出，代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩個，似是而非之人，你還在拒絕成為我們的同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你吃下了許多同族。卻拒絕成為種群的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......選擇吧。時間不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"捕食，獲取養分，回歸大群。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或是，停下你軀體的活動，放棄你生命的權力，交給其他同胞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"選。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾麗妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在！呃，什麼？你喊我名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你還有辦法回到陸地上嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對抗不了海嗣，但是伊比利亞可以。我背負著最後的警告。你們所遭遇的，歌蕾蒂婭所看見的，我統統要帶回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽上去就像個信使。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒關係，我是什麼都可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的船就快沉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六十年，六十多年了。因為你們的到來，我們不得不迎接這個結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"舊伊比利亞是如何談論偉大的阿方索船長的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“石榴樹下的阿方索”“英雄阿方索”“沉淪者阿方索”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有不少人......始終堅信，斯圖提斐拉號，沒有沉沒。但是，我們沒法出海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......您如果真的是阿方索閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就是曾經無數伊比利亞軍人心中的偶像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......石榴樹......矯情。"},{"type":"narration","text":"船長的眼中閃過一瞬間激昂的情感。\n自烏雲和滔天巨浪像囚籠一樣困住他們之後，這是他極少數的，動容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它變虛弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會拖住它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爆、爆炸！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我想源石爐應該早就不能用了，但剛才的衝擊點燃了引擎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火會燒上來，我還真沒什麼機會把它們烤著吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"narration","text":"溫度令海嗣感到不安。\n它變得虛弱。它的同胞在圍堵它。它接觸不到海洋。\n它在呼喚。可呼喚得不到回應。\n不。有同胞來了。近了。它能聽見同胞的聲音。\n同胞說——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——死吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭沒有任何猶豫。斯卡蒂與幽靈鯊斬斷了它的身體。\n它試圖癒合，試圖掙脫，但這一次，阿方索死死扯住了它的身體。\n用船長那隻早已變異的手。\n它感到生命在流逝。\n它看見幽靈鯊再度高舉武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見了，阿瑪雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次就一筆勾銷吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鹽風主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼？你又想和她交談？這個雜種能告訴你什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不理解，昆圖斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她告訴了我，她在阿戈爾的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鹽風主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"這又怎麼樣？如果你想獲取知識，使者可以告訴你更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鹽風主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"只要呼喚來自深海的聲音，你可以得到所有你想要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說你不理解，昆圖斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想剖析的，見證的，輕撫的，摧毀的，從來都不是那些城市。陸上的，水中的，都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想聽他們的生活。他們曾有著怎樣美好的生活，又如何建立社會，保衛家園。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們如何自相殘殺，如何迎接毀滅，像我們一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鹽風主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"褻瀆阿戈爾的是你這樣的阿戈爾人，褻瀆伊比利亞的是我這樣的伊比利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......實驗的結論我已經明白了。還需要更多對照，她會瘋掉，也會記恨我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她會恨我們，說實話，我其實也討厭他們。自我毀滅的戰士，自以為是的國度，自投羅網的行徑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......你偶爾也得承認我們更像他們，更像人類，我們離海嗣還很遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿瑪雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們會永遠地爭鬥下去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g25_goldenboat_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——成功了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，阿方索船長，您還好嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......比起我的船，不算太壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真的死了嗎？阿瑪雅？沒那麼容易吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抽動著肢體）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別給它時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（晃動著身體）勞倫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。我就在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在情況好像完全反過來了，阿瑪雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，我對於......科學實驗，一向是不感興趣的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伴隨肌肉撕裂的顫抖）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死吧，努力變化的劣等生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被遺忘吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這下清淨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"海嗣......更多海嗣就在這附近，它們在靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這艘船就要沉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使在我意識朦朧的時刻，我也知道你們為了抵達這裡付出了多少努力，但看來這一次，我們又要碰壁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劍魚，你要的東西呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......烏爾比安帶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無法保存這艘艦船上的技術原型，是我們的失敗。但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們絕非一無所獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"船長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無所謂，加西亞已經說了，今天是航行的最後一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......漫長的時間，我們掙扎求生的意志，也在被消磨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起初，我們最大的敵人是焦慮、猜忌、不安和恐懼。但後來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的情緒在離我們遠去。唯獨對海洋的渴望時刻挑釁著神經，他們一個接一個忘記，忘記身為“愚人號”船員的榮耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著他們一個個跳入海裡，或在那之前，被我斬首。我承認......這是有極限的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"漫長的求生也走到盡頭了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海水正在灌入這艘船。溟痕正迅速侵蝕這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......審判官，這裡的科技，這些源石爐的技術，對現在的伊比利亞有用嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯圖提斐拉上的一切都是伊比利亞的寶貴財產......大靜謐後，伊比利亞有相當部分的島民科技無法復現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光是因為失去了艦隊與城市，也因為，我們審判了那些阿戈爾人，我們失去了那麼多的人才。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......必須的。我至今仍不覺得，充滿軟弱與懷柔的策略能夠對抗深海教會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果今天，我們被迫失去了斯圖提斐拉——“愚人號”，我想......這是重大的損失，但也是早已註定的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，大放厥詞......國教會如今竟然已是這副模樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保護好這個伊比利亞人。她可遊不回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我答應你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"爆炸更嚴重了——這裡在傾斜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開這裡，斯卡蒂，切開你頭上的擋板！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g21_goldenboat_deck"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快！艾麗妮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我知道！可是阿方索呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"char_263_skadi","isRemote":false,"text":"洋流帶我們走了多遠？還是在原地打轉？這裡是它們巢穴的上方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論如何，看來我們得遊回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什、什麼？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g22_goldenboat_hall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......走。滾出我的船，就像我一開始說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。我會待在這裡。這裡是我的伊比利亞，我絕不背叛我的船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿方索緩緩坐在王座上。他閉上眼。\n伊比利亞明媚的陽光斜打在甲板上時留下的溫度。\n葡萄酒莊的香氣。故鄉的旋律。\n濕潤的空房間。冒出新芽的培養皿。\n海浪。\n曾經的大海。加西亞的手的溫度，布雷奧甘的落寞神色，卡門的笑容。戰友們震天的咆哮。\n他睜開眼，在大火燒毀這一切前，阿方索放聲大笑。\n他的笑聲穿過了時間，直到那座能聞到海風氣味的石榴花小鎮之中，與一位嬰兒的第一聲哭啼交相迭起。\n阿方索，人們這麼稱呼他。\n他舉起了那把鏽跡斑斑的刀，搭在自己的脖頸上。他祈禱著。他笑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......多可笑！記住吧，艾麗妮！去陸上歌頌阿方索的事蹟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"船長阿方索","speakerId":"avg_npc_446_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿方索殺死的最後一隻怪物，是他自己！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i37"},{"type":"narration","text":"船隻崩裂。\n火光映照著這片已經沉寂了近百年的海洋。\n一個時代的消亡。\n一段傳奇的遠去。\n遠方，陽光亮起。\n斯圖提斐拉沉沒於此，帶著伊比利亞，乃至所有文明始終未完成的夙願。\n臣服於災厄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我似乎聽見了......什麼聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，老了，會有些錯覺吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......您在流淚？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"水？\n對了......\n斯圖提斐拉號，沉沒了。\n我在海裡？海......海是危險的。\n危險，對。\n必須回到伊比利亞！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！咕——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼呼吸，你可做不到在水下呼吸。大部分阿戈爾人也做不到。"},{"type":"narration","text":"我想要回答什麼。當然，我也沒法在水裡說話。\n儘管竭力想要遏制本能，但我還是止不住抓著她的衣服，像個手足無措的孩子。\n但是，我看見了。\n她的瞳孔裡有光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i38"},{"type":"narration","text":"光來自海底。\n幽靈鯊什麼也沒說，但我能感到，她環抱著我的手臂在微微發抖。\n也許是剛才的戰鬥導致的？也許呢？又或者，和那裡的光有關？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶你上去，堅持住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——咕！"},{"type":"narration","text":"視野模糊。\n原來，海底，是這副模樣。\n那——\n——這就是，阿戈爾嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣靜靜看著遠處沉沒的火光。\n船沉入大海。火沉入大海。一切都沉入大海。\n同胞們回應它的呼喚而來。同胞都回到大群。\n在大群的簇擁下，只消片刻，它垂死的生命便重富活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。我帶你們，回到家鄉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——和阿方索，一起，死去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"大副死死咬住海嗣，一路衝向昏暗的海底。\n它的愛人。它的記憶。它的身份。它衝刺的速度逐漸緩慢，它的意識溶解於海洋。\n但它仍然咬著海嗣。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海水，讓你懷戀。遊動，令你覺醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"承認吧。你是大群的一員，我們等待許久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......加西亞......我是......阿方索的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你為何停下了遊動？你的信號與我相仿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受的傷都在癒合，你在接納自己的身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不？"},{"type":"narration","text":"大副的意識在模糊。\n是它在撕咬著這隻海嗣？還是，它只是主動衝進這隻海嗣的懷中，尋求它的擁抱？\n它......它只能承認。\n海水令它無比舒暢。海嗣的想法充盈著它的腦海。\n它是加西亞，是斯圖提斐拉號的大副？\n不，它是海嗣，它是大群的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咕——（噴吐氣泡的聲音）嘎哈——（氣泡破裂的聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是以人類的身份死去的。加西亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比阿瑪雅強一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......烏爾......同胞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_455_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大副","speakerId":"avg_npc_452_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝......謝......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"烏爾比安注視著彷彿相擁的二者沉入海底。它們在墜落中收縮，枯萎，像是一朵並蒂而生的花，在某個深度，被暗流沖散。\n直到這一切都消失在視野中，他才抬起頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_i38"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼會？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烏爾比安","speakerId":"avg_npc_445_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌蕾蒂婭，你必須聽從我的告誡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]},{"speakerId":"char_263_skadi","aliases":["斯卡蒂"]}]}
